      "body": "[Github 项目地址](https://github.com/Jack-S-H/ShiCi)\n\n实现在网页中翻译，记录，标记英文单词，标记的单词可以弹出单词卡片，标记还可以同步到所有网页，方便学习。\n\n本人还处于初学阶段，如有问题，欢迎指导。\n\n<img width=\"328\" height=\"258\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99465494-8500-4f5f-9d65-e2d4bc58e5ec\" />\n\n<img width=\"1604\" height=\"669\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7fd4efa-9397-4e3b-a916-b765c7f7edd1\" />",
